nted Redis from crashing when adding samples to a compressed Time Series key restored from a malformed RDB payload\r\n- RedisSearch: KNN queries on indexes with very long vector field names could cause the server to crash\r\n- Vector Sets: Deeply nested JSON used in Vector Set queries could cause the server to crash","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/redis/releases/390823002/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}